Stupid error. I used godot engine from 3.1 to 4-beta. But i did not see this error. I solved that:
add empty node in project and give "game" and "path" name. Copy this for every script. 

@onready var Game = get_node("/root/game_world/game") #game object and variables
@onready var Path = get_node("/root/game_world/path") #game's all paths is in script
